backlight: add a device-tree driver for the TI LM3530 in I2C mode

The in-tree leds-lm3530 driver is platform-data only. The Nest J49 has an LM3530
on I2C3 at 0x36 (HWEN gpio177, VAUX1 supply) driving the panel backlight; this
small backlight-class driver reproduces the stock init sequence (29.5 mA full
scale, exponential ramp, ALS off) and exposes /sys/class/backlight/lm3530.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: J49 project <j49@users.noreply.github.com>

